WEBVTT

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:11.220
今天不要上班，咪养你。
No work today. I'll take care of you.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.480
啊对，今天休假。我忘关闹钟啦。
Oh, right. It's my day off. I forgot the alarm.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:25.240
你：乖宝过来，给我亲一口
You: Come here, baby, give me a kiss.

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:27.250
啵，亲一口，送到。
Mwah. One kiss. Delivered.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:44.460
这只要朝这里。咪本来就知道。
This one faces here. Mii knew.

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:42.840
你：穿上拖鞋，跟咪去厨房
You: Put on your slippers and follow Mate to the kitchen.

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:45.210
穿上拖鞋，跟咪来。
Slippers on. Follow Mii.

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:56.540
厨房准备好了。咪上岗。
Kitchen ready. Mii is on duty.

00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:00.440
你：让咪把吐司抹上果酱
You: Let Mate spread jam on the toast.

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:02.880
吐司抹果酱，咪来。
Jam toast. Mii's on it.

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:17.950
咪试了下果酱。不是故意的。
Mii tested the jam. Not on purpose.

00:01:15.540 --> 00:01:18.040
你：好吧，我尝尝咪抹的爪印吐司
You: Okay, let me try the paw-print toast Mate spread.

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:21.560
给你。咪的特制吐司。
Here. Mii's special toast.

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:29.920
咔嚓……
Crunch...

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:33.300
味道怎么样？咪再做一份。
How is it? Mii will make another.

00:01:33.140 --> 00:01:35.640
你：不吃啦，咪我们出门去玩好不好
You: I'm full, Mate. Shall we go out and play?

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:37.980
要出去玩？咪准备好了！
Out to play? Mii is ready!

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:48.380
钥匙放进去了。咪准备好了。
Keys in. Mii is ready.

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:53.980
我们出去玩吧！
Let's go play!

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:53.240
你：咪，我们去公园追球玩好不好
You: Mate, shall we go to the park and chase the ball?

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:55.660
去公园？咪准备好了！
Out to the park? Mii is ready!

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:06.420
我们到了。Mii会去追的！
We're here. Mii will chase it!

00:02:06.820 --> 00:02:09.120
抓到了！咪好快！
Got it! Mii is fast!

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:10.840
你：咪真棒！不玩球啦，我们去电影院看电影吧
You: Great job, Mate! No more ball games. Let's go see a movie at the cinema.

00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:13.420
谢谢！看电影时间到。咪最爱看电影了！
Thank you! Movie time. Mii loves movies!

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:24.580
我们到了。最好的位子。
We made it. Best seats.

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:29.200
嘘，要开始了。
Shh. It's starting.

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:28.440
你：让咪靠过来一起看
You: Let Mate come closer and watch together.

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:31.310
靠过来？好，咪来了。
Closer? Okay. Mii is coming.

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:41.900
暖暖的。咪很舒服。
Warm. Mii is comfy.

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:46.040
你：伸手轻轻摸摸咪的头
You: Reach out and gently pat Mate's head.

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:50.060
嗯。就是那里。
Mmm. Right there.

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:56.820
咪想起来了。该做午饭啦！
Mii remembers. Lunch time!

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:03.640
你：咪等等，我们先拍张合照再回去做饭
You: Wait, Mate. Let's take a photo together first, then go back and cook.

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:06.010
拍照？好。咪最好看的这一面。
Photo? Okay. Mii's best side.

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:14.400
笑一个，茄子！咔嚓！
Say cheese. Click!

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:18.880
咪说：笑一个。咔嚓！
Pretty. Now lunch. Mii goes first.

00:03:18.740 --> 00:03:21.240
你：好啦好啦回家，路上抱着你走，咪累不累
You: Okay, okay, let's go home. I'll carry you on the way. Are you tired, Mate?

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:26.800
不累。咪被抱着。回家！
Not tired. Mii is carried. Home!

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:38.300
咪试了下果酱。不是故意的。
Mii tested the jam. Not on purpose.

00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:38.840
你：鼓励咪：再来一次
You: Encourage Mate: Try again.

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:42.180
酱粘住了。第二回合。咪听话。
The sauce stuck. Round two. Mii listens.

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:41.260
谢谢你。第二回合，咪这次听话。
Thank you. Round two. Mii listens.

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:52.210
做好了。咪觉得这也算颠锅。
Done. Mii counts this as tossing.

00:03:52.610 --> 00:03:56.040
要尝尝吗？
Taste it?

00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:56.440
你：咪好棒！吃完饭我们去夜里散步看路灯好不好
You: Good job, Mate! After dinner, shall we take a night walk and look at the streetlights?

00:03:57.440 --> 00:04:02.170
谢谢你！先吃饭，然后看路灯。
Thank you! Dinner first, then lamps.

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:09.370
做好啦。给你的小碗。
Done. Tiny bowl for you.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:13.100
晚上散步。咪带路。
Night walk later. Mii will lead.

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:14.040
你：好香呀！咪也坐下一起吃，吃完带你去看路灯
You: It smells so good! Mate, sit down and eat with me. After this, I'll take you to see the streetlights.

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:20.540
好香！咪也坐下。先去餐桌。
Yum! Mii sits too. Table first.

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:27.240
小小一口。咪吹了两遍。
Tiny bite. Mii blew on it twice.

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:31.000
一起吃。然后看路灯！
Eat together. Then lamps!
